@startuml
[*] as Initial State
New Account as NA
Registered User as RU
Logged-In User as LIU
Ticket Booked as TB
Account Managed as AM
Final State (Account Closed) as FSC
Final State (User Removed) as FSR
Final State (Ticket Cancelled) as FST

NA ->> RU : Successful registration
RU ->> LIU : Login attempt with valid credentials
LIU ->> TB : Ticket booking confirmed
TB ->> FST : Ticket cancellation
LIU ->> AM : Account editing/deletion request
AM ->> FSC : Account closed
RU ->> FSR : User removed by administrator

note right of NA: Create new account
note left of RU: Validate registration data
note right of LIU: Check ticket status
note left of TB: Payment confirmation
note right of AM: Edit or delete account details
note left of FST: Cancel ticket booking
note right of FSC: Close account
note left of FSR: Remove user's account

Initial State ->> NA : Create new account
NA ->> RU : Successful registration
RU ->> LIU : Login attempt with valid credentials
LIU ->> TB : Ticket booking confirmed
TB ->> FST : Ticket cancellation
LIU ->> AM : Account editing/deletion request
AM ->> FSC : Account closed
RU ->> FSR : User removed by administrator

@enduml
